#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:2
msgid "Full HA RPM Upgrade"
msgstr "Full-HA-RPM-Upgrade"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:4
msgid ""
"The following covers upgrading the |morpheus| App nodes in Full HA "
"Architecture configurations to |morphver|."
msgstr "Im Folgenden wird das Upgrade der |morpheus|-App-Knoten in Full-HA-Architekturkonfigurationen auf |morphver| beschrieben."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:6
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:11
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:57
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:106
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Wichtig"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:6
msgid ""
"The following is only for Full HA Architecture configurations, where "
"MySQL, Elasticsearch and RabbitMQ services are external to the App nodes."
msgstr "Das Folgende gilt nur für Full-HA-Architekturkonfigurationen, bei denen MySQL-, Elasticsearch- und RabbitMQ-Dienste außerhalb der App-Knoten liegen."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:9
msgid "|nonRollingUpgradeVer| or lower -> |morphver| Upgrade"
msgstr "|nonRollingUpgradeVer| oder niedriger -> |morphver|-Upgrade"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:11
msgid ""
"It is important to stop the morpheus-ui service on all app nodes prior to"
" upgrade. Failure to do so will result in a flood of log errors due to "
"previous message serialization conflict. The messages will eventually "
"expire and the logs will clear."
msgstr "Es ist wichtig, den morpheus-ui-Dienst auf allen App-Knoten vor dem Upgrade zu stoppen. Andernfalls kommt es zu einer Flut von Protokollfehlern aufgrund eines Konflikts bei der Serialisierung früherer Nachrichten. Die Nachrichten laufen schließlich ab, und die Protokolle werden geleert."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:13
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:66
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Warnung"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:13
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:66
msgid ""
"|morpheus| |morphver| contains new node and VM node packages that require"
" 3.5GB of storage. It is safe to run ``sudo rm -Rf /var/opt/morpheus"
"/package-repos/*`` after |morphver| package installation and before "
"reconfigure to clean old node and vm node packages from the package-repo "
"when room is needed."
msgstr "|morpheus| |morphver| enthält neue Node- und VM-Node-Pakete, die 3,5 GB Speicherplatz benötigen. Es ist unbedenklich, nach der Installation des |morphver|-Pakets und vor dem Reconfigure ``sudo rm -Rf /var/opt/morpheus/package-repos/*`` auszuführen, um alte Node- und VM-Node-Pakete aus dem package-repo zu entfernen, wenn Platz benötigt wird."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:15
msgid ""
"Starting with App Node 3, on **All** App Nodes, stop the morpheus-ui "
"services via ``morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui``. If you receive a timeout,"
" run ``morpheus-ctl graceful-kill morpheus-ui``."
msgstr "Beginnen Sie mit App-Knoten 3 und stoppen Sie auf **allen** App-Knoten die morpheus-ui-Dienste mit ``morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui``. Bei einem Timeout führen Sie ``morpheus-ctl graceful-kill morpheus-ui`` aus."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:17
msgid "[root@app-server-3 ~]# morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:21
msgid "[root@app-server-2 ~]# morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:25
msgid "[root@app-server-1 ~]# morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:29
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:68
msgid ""
"Upgrade the RPM package on App Node 1, then run a Reconfigure on App Node"
" 1"
msgstr "Aktualisieren Sie das RPM-Paket auf App-Knoten 1 und führen Sie anschließend ein Reconfigure auf App-Knoten 1 aus"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:31
msgid ""
"[root@app-server-1 ~]# sudo wget https://packageUrl.morpheus-"
"appliance-x.x.x-x.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@app-server-1 ~]# sudo rpm -Uhv morpheus-"
"appliance-x.x.x-x.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@app-server-1 ~]# sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:37
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:64
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Hinweis"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:37
msgid ""
"All services will automatically be stopped and started during the "
"reconfigure process. After the reconfigure has succeeded, tail the ui "
"service to watch ui startup logs with ``morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui``."
msgstr "Während des Reconfigure-Prozesses werden alle Dienste automatisch gestoppt und gestartet. Nach erfolgreichem Reconfigure verfolgen Sie die Startprotokolle des UI-Dienstes mit ``morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui``."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:39
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:80
msgid ""
"Once App Node 1 upgrade has completed and the ui is available, upgrade "
"the RPM package on App Node 2, then run a Reconfigure on App Node 2."
msgstr "Sobald das Upgrade von App-Knoten 1 abgeschlossen und die UI verfügbar ist, aktualisieren Sie das RPM-Paket auf App-Knoten 2 und führen Sie anschließend ein Reconfigure auf App-Knoten 2 aus."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:41
msgid ""
"[root@app-server-2 ~]# sudo wget https://packageUrl.morpheus-"
"appliance-x.x.x-x.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@app-server-2 ~]# sudo rpm -Uhv morpheus-"
"appliance-x.x.x-x.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@app-server-2 ~]# sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:47
msgid ""
"Then upgrade the RPM package on App Node 3, then run a Reconfigure on App"
" Node 3"
msgstr "Aktualisieren Sie anschließend das RPM-Paket auf App-Knoten 3 und führen Sie anschließend ein Reconfigure auf App-Knoten 3 aus"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:49
msgid ""
"[root@app-server-3 ~]# sudo wget https://packageUrl.morpheus-"
"appliance-x.x.x-x.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@app-server-3 ~]# sudo rpm -Uhv morpheus-"
"appliance-x.x.x-x.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@app-server-3 ~]# sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:55
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:104
msgid ""
"The upgrade is complete and the |morpheus|-ui services should be running "
"with clustered Elasticsearch and RabbitMQ services across the 3 nodes."
msgstr "Das Upgrade ist abgeschlossen, und die |morpheus|-ui-Dienste sollten mit geclusterten Elasticsearch- und RabbitMQ-Diensten über die 3 Knoten laufen."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:57
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:106
msgid ""
"If reconfigure after a rpm package upgrade stalls or hangs on starting a "
"local service it is possible the ``morpheus-runsvdir`` service did not "
"start or a process it was managing was manually shutdown or killed. To "
"resolve, run ``systemctl stop morpheus-runsvdir`` then ``systemctl start "
"morpheus-runsvdir``, then run reconfigure again, ``morpheus-ctl "
"reconfigure``."
msgstr "Wenn das Reconfigure nach einem rpm-Paket-Upgrade beim Starten eines lokalen Dienstes hängt oder stockt, wurde der Dienst ``morpheus-runsvdir`` möglicherweise nicht gestartet oder ein von ihm verwalteter Prozess manuell heruntergefahren oder beendet. Zur Behebung führen Sie ``systemctl stop morpheus-runsvdir`` und anschließend ``systemctl start morpheus-runsvdir`` aus und starten Sie das Reconfigure erneut mit ``morpheus-ctl reconfigure``."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:62
msgid "|minRollingUpgradeVer| -> |morphver| Upgrade"
msgstr "|minRollingUpgradeVer| -> |morphver|-Upgrade"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:64
msgid ""
"Rolling upgrades are supported for |minRollingUpgradeVer| -> |morphver| "
"only."
msgstr "Rolling Upgrades werden nur für |minRollingUpgradeVer| -> |morphver| unterstützt."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:70
msgid ""
"[root@app-server-1 ~]# sudo wget https://packageUrl.morpheus-"
"appliance-x.x.x-x.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@app-server-1 ~]# sudo rpm -Uhv morpheus-"
"appliance-x.x.x-x.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@app-server-1 ~]# sudo morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui\n"
"[root@app-server-1 ~]# sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure\n"
"[root@app-server-1 ~]# sudo morpheus-ctl start morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:78
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:90
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:102
msgid ""
"After the reconfigure has succeeded, tail the ui service to watch ui "
"startup logs with ``morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui``."
msgstr "Nach erfolgreichem Reconfigure verfolgen Sie die Startprotokolle des UI-Dienstes mit ``morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui``."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:82
msgid ""
"[root@app-server-2 ~]# sudo wget https://packageUrl.morpheus-"
"appliance-x.x.x-x.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@app-server-2 ~]# sudo rpm -Uhv morpheus-"
"appliance-x.x.x-x.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@app-server-2 ~]# sudo morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui\n"
"[root@app-server-2 ~]# sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure\n"
"[root@app-server-2 ~]# sudo morpheus-ctl start morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:92
msgid ""
"Once App Node 2 upgrade has completed and the u is available, upgrade the"
" RPM package on App Node 3, then run a Reconfigure on App Node 3"
msgstr "Sobald das Upgrade von App-Knoten 2 abgeschlossen und die UI verfügbar ist, aktualisieren Sie das RPM-Paket auf App-Knoten 3 und führen Sie anschließend ein Reconfigure auf App-Knoten 3 aus"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/upgrades/fullha/rpm.rst:94
msgid ""
"[root@app-server-3 ~]# sudo wget https://packageUrl.morpheus-"
"appliance-x.x.x-x.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@app-server-3 ~]# sudo rpm -Uhv morpheus-"
"appliance-x.x.x-x.x86_64.rpm\n"
"[root@app-server-3 ~]# sudo morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui\n"
"[root@app-server-3 ~]# sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure\n"
"[root@app-server-3 ~]# sudo morpheus-ctl start morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

